  "adaptation": {
    "rendering": "Go/MyGo controls; semantic Material Symbols SVG equivalents for business icons. Selection indicator remains the fixed shared Check SVG; submenu arrows reuse the fixed16px decorative Chevron SVG rotated for LTR/RTL without text-bidi mirroring.",
    "state": "Each recipe has independent persistent checks and radio state from its source defaults; repeated bindings inside one source recipe share state.",
    "actions": "Source application/backend placeholders are local status actions; no external navigation or pretend filesystem/network effects.",
    "avatar": "Existing original shadcn Card avatar bitmap reused; account and top/end avatar triggers preserved.",
    "placement": "Create Sides exposes all six source sides; logical sides resolve from context direction. NativeOS uses platform menu tracking and does not promise source placement.",
    "inset": "Logical start8→32px (+24); group captions independently inset. Checkbox/radio reserve logical end32px with Check16px at end8px and independent leading business icon.",
    "close": "Styled ordinary actions close; checkboxes/radio stay open by default per archived BaseUI1.6.0; CloseOnSelect overrides a row, KeepOpenOnSelect takes priority. Native/legacy keep platform SDK tracking.",
    "dialog": "Real source Dialog contains dropdown; menu content renders through the independent desktop Host.",
    "native": "NativeDropdownMenu always requests SystemMenus. Source business icons are recursively converted with mygo.NewMenuIconSVG into cached template ui.MenuIcon handles. The OS owns final icon presentation, style, placement, state, disabled/destructive/shortcut tracking; source rich visual styling is not simulated."
  }
